	"<h1>Best AI Chatbots for Business (2026)</h1>\n<p><span class=\"pill\">💬 AI Chat</span></p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 2026-07-27</em></p>\n<p>AI chatbots now handle 60%+ of routine support and lead questions automatically.</p>\n<p>We tested 8 platforms on answer quality, CRM integration, and handoff.</p>\n<h2>Top Picks at a Glance</h2>\n<table><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n<th>Starting Price</th>\n<th>Rating</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Intercom Fin</td>\n<td>Support</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.0/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Zendesk AI</td>\n<td>Suite</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.9/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ada</td>\n<td>No-code</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.8/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drift</td>\n<td>Conversational</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.7/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chatbase</td>\n<td>Train on data</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.6/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Tidio</td>\n<td>SMB</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.5/10</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>How We Tested</h2>\n<p>We spent 6+ weeks putting each option through real-world tasks: signing up, funding accounts, running campaigns, and measuring output quality, speed, and support responsiveness.</p>\n<p>Our ratings weight long-term value, transparency of pricing, and reliability most heavily — not just flashy features.</p>\n<h2>Detailed Comparison</h2>\n<p>Our #1 pick, <strong>Intercom Fin</strong>, stands out for Support at $0+ — the best all-round choice for most users. Close behind, <strong>Zendesk AI</strong> is the value winner, while <strong>Ada</strong> is ideal if you prioritize a specific workflow.</p>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<table><tr><th>✅ Pros</th><th>❌ Cons</th></tr><tr>\n<td><ul><li>✓ 24/7 support</li><li>✓ Lower costs</li><li>✓ Lead capture</li></ul></td>\n<td><ul><li>✗ Setup time</li><li>✗ Hallucinations</li><li>✗ Escalation needed</li></ul></td>\n</tr></table>\n<h2>Who Should Choose This</h2>\n<p>If you are just starting out, favor the lowest-friction option with a generous free tier. Experienced users should optimize for advanced controls and integrations.</p>\n<p>Budget-conscious readers get 90%% of the value from the value-pick without overspending on enterprise extras.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Can chatbots replace humans?</summary><p>They handle tier-1 volume; complex or emotional issues still need human agents.</p></details>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\"><strong>Final Verdict:</strong> <strong>Intercom Fin</strong> is the support leader; <strong>Chatbase</strong> is best for training a bot on your own docs. <strong>Rating: ⭐ 9.0/10</strong></div>\n<p><em>This article may contain affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you purchase through our links. All reviews are independent.</em></p>\n",
