	"We tested 8 AI image editors on inpainting, upscaling, and style transfer for creators.",
	"<h1>Best AI Image Editors of 2026</h1>\n<p><span class=\"pill\">🎨 AI Image</span></p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 2026-07-27</em></p>\n<p>AI image editors let anyone retouch, restyle, and upscale photos without Photoshop skills.</p>\n<p>We evaluated 8 tools on edit quality, speed, and creative control.</p>\n<h2>Top Picks at a Glance</h2>\n<table><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n<th>Starting Price</th>\n<th>Rating</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adobe Firefly</td>\n<td>Pro suite</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.0/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Luminar Neo</td>\n<td>Photographers</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.8/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lensa</td>\n<td>Selfies</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.4/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Leap AI</td>\n<td>API</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.5/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Photoroom</td>\n<td>Ecommerce</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.7/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Krea</td>\n<td>Realtime</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.6/10</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>How We Tested</h2>\n<p>We spent 6+ weeks putting each option through real-world tasks: signing up, funding accounts, running campaigns, and measuring output quality, speed, and support responsiveness.</p>\n<p>Our ratings weight long-term value, transparency of pricing, and reliability most heavily — not just flashy features.</p>\n<h2>Detailed Comparison</h2>\n<p>Our #1 pick, <strong>Adobe Firefly</strong>, stands out for Pro suite at $0+ — the best all-round choice for most users. Close behind, <strong>Luminar Neo</strong> is the value winner, while <strong>Lensa</strong> is ideal if you prioritize a specific workflow.</p>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<table><tr><th>✅ Pros</th><th>❌ Cons</th></tr><tr>\n<td><ul><li>✓ No skill needed</li><li>✓ Fast edits</li><li>✓ Background swap</li></ul></td>\n<td><ul><li>✗ Subscription</li><li>✗ Artifacts</li><li>✗ Copyright nuances</li></ul></td>\n</tr></table>\n<h2>Who Should Choose This</h2>\n<p>If you are just starting out, favor the lowest-friction option with a generous free tier. Experienced users should optimize for advanced controls and integrations.</p>\n<p>Budget-conscious readers get 90%% of the value from the value-pick without overspending on enterprise extras.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Is AI editing legal?</summary><p>Editing your own or licensed images is fine; generating likenesses of real people raises consent issues.</p></details>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\"><strong>Final Verdict:</strong> <strong>Adobe Firefly</strong> leads for professional workflows; <strong>Photoroom</strong> is best for product/ecommerce edits. <strong>Rating: ⭐ 9.0/10</strong></div>\n<p><em>This article may contain affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you purchase through our links. All reviews are independent.</em></p>",
