	"We tested 7 AI music tools on quality, licensing, and ease for creators and filmmakers.",
	"<h1>Best AI Music Generators of 2026</h1>\n<p><span class=\"pill\">🎵 AI Music</span></p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 2026-07-27</em></p>\n<p>AI music generation now produces royalty-free tracks for videos and games in seconds.</p>\n<p>We compared 7 tools on audio quality, commercial licensing, and prompts.</p>\n<h2>Top Picks at a Glance</h2>\n<table><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n<th>Starting Price</th>\n<th>Rating</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suno</td>\n<td>Vocal songs</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.0/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Udio</td>\n<td>High fidelity</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.9/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aiva</td>\n<td>Cinematic</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.6/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Soundraw</td>\n<td>Royalty-free</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.7/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boomy</td>\n<td>Quick tracks</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.3/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Loudly</td>\n<td>Stems</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.4/10</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>How We Tested</h2>\n<p>We spent 6+ weeks putting each option through real-world tasks: signing up, funding accounts, running campaigns, and measuring output quality, speed, and support responsiveness.</p>\n<p>Our ratings weight long-term value, transparency of pricing, and reliability most heavily — not just flashy features.</p>\n<h2>Detailed Comparison</h2>\n<p>Our #1 pick, <strong>Suno</strong>, stands out for Vocal songs at $0+ — the best all-round choice for most users. Close behind, <strong>Udio</strong> is the value winner, while <strong>Aiva</strong> is ideal if you prioritize a specific workflow.</p>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<table><tr><th>✅ Pros</th><th>❌ Cons</th></tr><tr>\n<td><ul><li>✓ Instant tracks</li><li>✓ Royalty-free (some)</li><li>✓ Mood control</li></ul></td>\n<td><ul><li>✗ Licensing fine print</li><li>✗ Generic feel</li><li>✗ Not final-master</li></ul></td>\n</tr></table>\n<h2>Who Should Choose This</h2>\n<p>If you are just starting out, favor the lowest-friction option with a generous free tier. Experienced users should optimize for advanced controls and integrations.</p>\n<p>Budget-conscious readers get 90%% of the value from the value-pick without overspending on enterprise extras.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Can I use AI music commercially?</summary><p>Check each platform's license — Soundraw and some tiers allow commercial use; others restrict it.</p></details>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\"><strong>Final Verdict:</strong> <strong>Suno</strong> and <strong>Udio</strong> lead on song quality; <strong>Soundraw</strong> for safe commercial licensing. <strong>Rating: ⭐ 9.0/10</strong></div>\n<p><em>This article may contain affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you purchase through our links. All reviews are independent.</em></p>",
