	"We tested 9 AI video tools on text-to-video, avatars, and editing for marketers.",
	"<h1>Best AI Video Generators of 2026</h1>\n<p><span class=\"pill\">🎬 AI Video</span></p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 2026-07-27</em></p>\n<p>AI video generation turns scripts and images into publishable clips without a camera.</p>\n<p>We compared 9 tools on output realism, avatars, and editing speed.</p>\n<h2>Top Picks at a Glance</h2>\n<table><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n<th>Starting Price</th>\n<th>Rating</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Runway</td>\n<td>Creative</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.1/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Synthesia</td>\n<td>Avatars</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.0/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HeyGen</td>\n<td>Speaking avatars</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.9/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pika</td>\n<td>Text-to-video</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.7/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>InVideo AI</td>\n<td>Templates</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.8/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Luma</td>\n<td>Dream Machine</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.6/10</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>How We Tested</h2>\n<p>We spent 6+ weeks putting each option through real-world tasks: signing up, funding accounts, running campaigns, and measuring output quality, speed, and support responsiveness.</p>\n<p>Our ratings weight long-term value, transparency of pricing, and reliability most heavily — not just flashy features.</p>\n<h2>Detailed Comparison</h2>\n<p>Our #1 pick, <strong>Runway</strong>, stands out for Creative at $0+ — the best all-round choice for most users. Close behind, <strong>Synthesia</strong> is the value winner, while <strong>HeyGen</strong> is ideal if you prioritize a specific workflow.</p>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<table><tr><th>✅ Pros</th><th>❌ Cons</th></tr><tr>\n<td><ul><li>✓ No crew needed</li><li>✓ Fast drafts</li><li>✓ Localization</li></ul></td>\n<td><ul><li>✗ Render limits</li><li>✗ Uncanny (some)</li><li>✗ Cost</li></ul></td>\n</tr></table>\n<h2>Who Should Choose This</h2>\n<p>If you are just starting out, favor the lowest-friction option with a generous free tier. Experienced users should optimize for advanced controls and integrations.</p>\n<p>Budget-conscious readers get 90%% of the value from the value-pick without overspending on enterprise extras.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Can AI clone my face for video?</summary><p>Yes via consent-based avatar tools like HeyGen, used for training and multilingual content.</p></details>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\"><strong>Final Verdict:</strong> <strong>Runway</strong> leads creative generation; <strong>Synthesia</strong> and <strong>HeyGen</strong> for talking-head avatar videos. <strong>Rating: ⭐ 9.1/10</strong></div>\n<p><em>This article may contain affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you purchase through our links. All reviews are independent.</em></p>",
