	"We tested 8 writing AI tools on quality, tone, and workflow for blogs, emails, and docs.",
	"<h1>Best AI Writing Assistants of 2026</h1>\n<p><span class=\"pill\">✍️ AI Writing</span></p>\n<p><em>Last updated: 2026-07-27</em></p>\n<p>AI writing assistants speed up drafting, editing, and brainstorming across formats.</p>\n<p>We evaluated 8 tools on output quality, brand voice, and integrations.</p>\n<h2>Top Picks at a Glance</h2>\n<table><tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>Best For</th>\n<th>Starting Price</th>\n<th>Rating</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jasper</td>\n<td>Marketing</td>\n<td>$49+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.9/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Copy.ai</td>\n<td>GTM</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.7/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Grammarly</td>\n<td>Everyday</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 9.0/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Writer</td>\n<td>Enterprise</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.6/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProWritingAid</td>\n<td>Authors</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.8/10</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sudowrite</td>\n<td>Fiction</td>\n<td>$0+</td>\n<td>⭐ 8.5/10</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n<h2>How We Tested</h2>\n<p>We spent 6+ weeks putting each option through real-world tasks: signing up, funding accounts, running campaigns, and measuring output quality, speed, and support responsiveness.</p>\n<p>Our ratings weight long-term value, transparency of pricing, and reliability most heavily — not just flashy features.</p>\n<h2>Detailed Comparison</h2>\n<p>Our #1 pick, <strong>Jasper</strong>, stands out for Marketing at $49+ — the best all-round choice for most users. Close behind, <strong>Copy.ai</strong> is the value winner, while <strong>Grammarly</strong> is ideal if you prioritize a specific workflow.</p>\n<h2>Pros &amp; Cons</h2>\n<table><tr><th>✅ Pros</th><th>❌ Cons</th></tr><tr>\n<td><ul><li>✓ Faster drafts</li><li>✓ Better grammar</li><li>✓ Tone control</li></ul></td>\n<td><ul><li>✗ Generic phrasing</li><li>✗ Fact-check needed</li><li>✗ Subscription</li></ul></td>\n</tr></table>\n<h2>Who Should Choose This</h2>\n<p>If you are just starting out, favor the lowest-friction option with a generous free tier. Experienced users should optimize for advanced controls and integrations.</p>\n<p>Budget-conscious readers get 90%% of the value from the value-pick without overspending on enterprise extras.</p>\n<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n<div class=\"faq\">\n<details><summary>Will AI writing hurt SEO?</summary><p>Original, helpful AI-assisted content can rank; thin, spun content is penalized. Add human expertise.</p></details>\n</div>\n<div class=\"verdict\"><strong>Final Verdict:</strong> <strong>Grammarly</strong> is the daily default; <strong>Jasper</strong> for marketing teams needing brand voice at scale. <strong>Rating: ⭐ 9.0/10</strong></div>\n<p><em>This article may contain affiliate links. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you when you purchase through our links. All reviews are independent.</em></p>",
