	"Microsoft Azure Guide",
	"A comprehensive guide to Microsoft Azure: cloud services, virtual machines, Azure DevOps, hybrid cloud capabilities, and how Azure integrates with Microsoft 365.",
	"<h1>Microsoft Azure Guide</h1>\n    <p>Microsoft Azure is a comprehensive cloud computing platform offering infrastructure, platform, and software-as-a-service solutions. Azure's strong integration with Microsoft's enterprise products, hybrid cloud capabilities, and extensive compliance certifications make it a popular choice for businesses and organizations worldwide.</p>\n\n    <h2>Core Infrastructure Services</h2>\n    <p>Azure Virtual Machines provides on-demand computing resources with support for Windows and Linux. Azure App Service offers a fully managed platform for web applications and APIs. Azure Functions provides serverless computing for event-driven applications. Azure's global infrastructure spans 60+ regions, more than any other cloud provider, ensuring low-latency access worldwide.</p>\n\n    <h2>Enterprise Integration</h2>\n    <p>Azure's tight integration with Microsoft 365, Dynamics 365, and Active Directory is a key advantage for enterprises. Azure Active Directory provides identity and access management, single sign-on, and multi-factor authentication. Hybrid cloud capabilities via Azure Arc allow organizations to manage on-premises, multi-cloud, and edge environments from a single control plane.</p>\n\n    <h2>Azure DevOps and Developer Tools</h2>\n    <p>Azure DevOps provides a complete set of development tools including Azure Repos (Git repositories), Azure Pipelines (CI/CD), Azure Boards (project management), and Azure Test Plans. Integration with GitHub, Visual Studio, and the broader Microsoft developer ecosystem makes Azure a natural choice for .NET developers and organizations using Microsoft technologies.</p>\n\n    <h2>AI and Cognitive Services</h2>\n    <p>Azure AI offers pre-built cognitive services for vision, speech, language, and decision-making, as well as Azure Machine Learning for building, training, and deploying custom models. Azure OpenAI Service provides access to GPT-4, DALL-E, and other advanced AI models with enterprise-grade security and compliance. This has become one of Azure's fastest-growing services.</p>\n\n    <h2>Security and Compliance</h2>\n    <p>Azure has the broadest compliance portfolio of any cloud provider, with over 100 compliance offerings including ISO 27001, SOC 2, HIPAA, and FedRAMP. Azure Security Center provides unified security management with advanced threat protection across hybrid workloads. Microsoft invests over $1 billion annually in cybersecurity research and development.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <p>Microsoft Azure is the cloud platform of choice for many enterprises, particularly those already invested in the Microsoft ecosystem. Its hybrid cloud capabilities, enterprise integration, and comprehensive compliance offerings make it a powerful platform for business-critical applications.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:12px;font-size:0.85em;opacity:0.7;\">📊 <span id=\"busuanzi_container_site_pv\">Total visits <span id=\"busuanzi_value_site_pv\"></span></span><span id=\"visitor-ip\"></span></p>\n    </div>\n    <script>fetch('https://api.ipify.org?format=json').then(r=>r.json()).then(d=>{var el=document.getElementById('visitor-ip');if(el&&d.ip){var ips=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('ip_list')||'[]');if(!ips.includes(d.ip)){ips.push(d.ip);localStorage.setItem('ip_list',JSON.stringify(ips))}el.innerHTML=' | 🖥️ Your IP: '+d.ip+' | Unique IPs: '+ips.length}}).catch(function(){})<\/script>\n    <div id=\"like-box\"></div>\n    <div id=\"related-articles\"></div>",
