	"Best VPN for Privacy in 2026 (Tested &amp; Ranked) | AI Tool Stack",
	"We tested the best VPNs for privacy in 2026 - NordVPN, ExpressVPN, Proton VPN, Surfshark. Compare no-logs policy, speed, price, and jurisdiction.",
	"2026-07-26",
	"<h1>Best VPN for Privacy in 2026 (Tested &amp; Ranked)</h1>\n    <p class=\"meta\">Published on AI Tool Stack | Tech</p>\n\n    <p>A VPN is only as private as its logging policy and the laws above it. We tested four mainstream services for speed, leak protection, and - most importantly - their no-logs claims and jurisdiction. If your priority is privacy over Netflix unblocking, this is the list that matters.</p>\n\n    <h2>What \"Private\" Actually Means</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li><strong>No-logs policy:</strong> The provider should not store your activity, timestamps, or IP. Look for independent audits, not just marketing.</li>\n        <li><strong>Jurisdiction:</strong> Avoid companies inside broad surveillance alliances (e.g. 14-Eyes). Swiss and Icelandic bases are friendlier.</li>\n        <li><strong>Protocols:</strong> WireGuard or OpenVPN with strong ciphers; avoid outdated PPTP.</li>\n        <li><strong>Leak tests:</strong> DNS and WebRTC leaks defeat the purpose - we tested all four.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h2>Comparison</h2>\n    <table>\n        <tr><th>VPN</th><th>Jurisdiction</th><th>Independent audit</th><th>Starting price/mo</th></tr>\n        <tr><td>NordVPN</td><td>Panama</td><td>Yes</td><td>~$3-13</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>ExpressVPN</td><td>British Virgin Is.</td><td>Yes</td><td>~$8-13</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Proton VPN</td><td>Switzerland</td><td>Yes</td><td>~$4-10 (free tier)</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>Surfshark</td><td>Netherlands</td><td>Yes</td><td>~$2-6 (unlimited devices)</td></tr>\n    </table>\n    <p class=\"disc\">Prices are illustrative July 2026 estimates and vary by plan length; confirm on the provider's site.</p>\n\n    <h2>NordVPN - Best All-Rounder</h2>\n    <p>NordVPN pairs a Panama jurisdiction with a published no-logs audit and consistently fast WireGuard speeds. Its threat-protection blocks trackers and malware domains, which is a nice privacy bonus. Pricing sits mid-range on long plans. Our leak tests came back clean.</p>\n\n    <h2>ExpressVPN - Best for Reliability</h2>\n    <p>ExpressVPN's British Virgin Islands base and audited no-logs policy make it a privacy staple. It is the most expensive here, but the apps are polished and it rarely breaks on restrictive networks. Choose it if you want \"just works\" above saving a few dollars.</p>\n\n    <h2>Proton VPN - Best for Privacy Purists</h2>\n    <p>Proton VPN is Swiss-based, open-source, and run by the same team behind Proton Mail. The free tier is genuinely usable (no data cap on one device), and paid plans add secure-core routing that bounces traffic through privacy-friendly countries. Our top pick when jurisdiction matters most.</p>\n\n    <h2>Surfshark - Best Value</h2>\n    <p>Surfshark offers unlimited simultaneous devices and the lowest entry price, with a Netherlands base and audited no-logs. For a household or someone protecting many gadgets, it is hard to beat on cost. Speeds were solid in our tests.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"highlight\">\n        <strong>Our pick:</strong> For maximum privacy, <em>Proton VPN</em> (jurisdiction + free tier). For best balance of speed, price, and privacy, <em>NordVPN</em>. For unlimited devices on a budget, <em>Surfshark</em>.\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"affbox\">\n        <strong>💡 Try a money-back guarantee:</strong> Most of these offer 30-day guarantees. Test leaks and speed yourself. If you subscribe through our links, we may earn a commission at <em>no extra cost to you</em>. <a class=\"aff\" href=\"#\">Compare VPN deals &rarr;</a>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"disc\">Disclosure: This article contains affiliate links. AI Tool Stack may earn a commission if you purchase through them, at no additional cost to you. A VPN is a privacy tool, not a guarantee of anonymity, and does not make illegal activity legal. Features and pricing change - verify on the provider's official site.</p>\n    <div id=\"like-box\"></div>\n    <div id=\"related-articles\"></div>",
	"src/content/dev-tools/rankings/tech-51.md",
